d:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-amber-400/40 bg-amber-500/10 px-4 py-3 font-mono-tech text-xs leading-relaxed text-cream/80","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-2 font-display font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-bright","children":"Editor note"}],"Findings are also delivered with the client's operational reality in mind. A vulnerability that is technically severe but sits behind three other controls is prioritised differently from the same vulnerability on an internet-facing system with no compensating control, and the remediation guidance reflects that distinction rather than a flat severity score copied from a scanner."]}]
